{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">謝賢離世｜謝賢（四哥）早前離世，令無數觀眾與圈中好友萬分不捨。曾與四哥合作無間的汪明荃（阿姐）於社交平台分享多張昔日兩人合演經典劇集主題曲的黑膠唱片封套，並撰寫長文追憶這位相交逾70載的好拍檔，字裡行間盡是傷感。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">汪明荃在文中感嘆自己非常幸運，能夠與四哥在電視黃金時代合作過五部經典電視劇，包括1979年《天虹》、1980年《千王之王》、1981年《千王羣英會》、1982年《萬水千山總是情》、1984年《秋瑾》。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f641fc3f-d7ff-4263-8017-68f0e633b2f7.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026SjMUQQHTvR1784703178.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f641fc3f-d7ff-4263-8017-68f0e633b2f7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">兩人當年螢幕火花十足，創造了無數陪伴幾代人成長的經典角色。兩人私下交情亦匪淺，阿姐透露四哥的女兒謝婷婷是她的契女，雙方關係親近：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「四哥的女兒婷婷還是我的契女，大家關係親近。他非常愛錫他的仔女，囝囝霆鋒的成就使佢很驕傲，終於有繼承人，兩個乖巧的孫兒更是他的寶貝。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6e1f0336-d056-49a3-ae92-e4935d673d9e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20263l2PIPOltq1784703185.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6e1f0336-d056-49a3-ae92-e4935d673d9e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">回顧四哥輝煌一生，阿姐大讚其對香港影視產業貢獻良多，一生參演約200部電影，晚年更榮獲香港電影金像獎最佳男主角，成就非凡。她又指四哥在圈中人緣極佳，拍戲時經常照顧及指導她：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">「那些開心的日子我會永遠記住，多謝佢。四哥是一個好人，他那燦爛的笑容，他那永遠风度翩翩的瀟灑模樣，相信一定會長留在我們心中。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T07:31:30.054020+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":491,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}